{"id":"vod_sn_38906","vodId":"38906","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"少年与水球","name_cn":"少年与水球","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ffec2f9c205a296c76d1cdda6fc3933d.jpg"},"summary":"清水凑（上村祐翔 配音）曾经是一名水球运动员，但由于一场意外的发生，导致他在初中三年级的时候决定放弃水球这项深爱的运动，升上高中后，凑在阴差阳错之下结识了名叫冈荣太郎（西山宏太朗 配音）的男生。荣太郎是凑曾经的校友，因此十分了解凑身上所发生的那些悲惨的故事，亦十分向往能够和凑就读同一所高中。　　城岛让（木村昴 配音）是水球社的社长，在他的苦心劝说之下，凑终于同意了加入水球社。曾经是游泳能手的网滨秀吾（齐藤壮马 配音）、个性十分容易冲动，大大咧咧的江尻武一（古川慎 配音）、温文尔雅性格平和的猪俣巴巴亚罗丰（畠中祐 配音），在学校里，凑很快就交上了朋友，也重新拾起了对于水球运动的热情。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:05:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FwuJijAhCE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bpXy96GFjZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xf3F3KUqmr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BiMiTMLc921/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LgsXeunXEq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hD1CRMtcnV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CQkahBr4Rf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/psPiGpbifs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tGsQRinF481/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/s5EBGhs7yB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sv8PNH8aAQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FXEpWC80fb1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:52.863Z"}